REST API me GET mapping ke liye best convention ka matlab hai ke aapke URL design aur naming clean, consistent, aur industry standards follow karein.
Main aapko Roman Urdu me best practices bata deta hoon:

1. Nouns use karein, Verbs nahi

❌ Galat: /getAllUsers
✅ Sahi: /users

Reason: HTTP method (GET) already batata hai ke hum data fetch kar rahe hain, isliye URL me verb likhne ki zarurat nahi.

2. Plural form use karein

Resource names plural hon taki consistent lagein.
✅ /users → saare users
✅ /users/10 → sirf ek user

3. Hierarchy dikhayein (Nested Resources)

Agar ek resource ka relation dusre se ho, to URL me hierarchy dikhayein.
Example:
✅ /users/10/orders → user ID 10 ke saare orders
✅ /users/10/orders/5 → ek specific order

4. Filters aur Parameters ka use karein

GET request me search ya filter karne ke liye query params use karein.
✅ /users?role=admin
✅ /products?category=mobile&sort=price

5. Hyphen (-) ka use karein, underscore (_) nahi

Reason: Hyphen URLs me zyada readable hota hai aur SEO friendly hota hai.
✅ /user-profiles
❌ /user_profiles

6. Lowercase use karein

✅ /user-profiles
❌ /UserProfiles

Example Best GET Mapping:

@GetMapping("/users")
public List<User> getAllUsers() { ... }

@GetMapping("/users/{id}")
public User getUserById(@PathVariable Long id) { ... }

@GetMapping("/users/{id}/orders")
public List<Order> getUserOrders(@PathVariable Long id) { ... }
